{"n":63,"name":"Al-Munafiqun","nameAr":"المنافقون","meaning":"The Hypocrites","ayahs":11,"place":"madinah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":28,"ar":"إِذَا جَآءَكَ ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ قَالُوا۟ نَشْهَدُ إِنَّكَ لَرَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ إِنَّكَ لَرَسُولُهُۥ وَٱللَّهُ يَشْهَدُ إِنَّ ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en":"When the hypocrites come to you, [O Muḥammad], they say, \"We testify that you are the Messenger of Allāh.\" And Allāh knows that you are His Messenger, and Allāh testifies that the hypocrites are liars.","w":[{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"When"},{"ar":"جَآءَكَ","tr":"jāaka","en":"come to you","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ","tr":"l-munāfiqūna","en":"the hypocrites","root":"نفق","lem":"مُنافِق"},{"ar":"قَالُوا۟","tr":"qālū","en":"they say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"نَشْهَدُ","tr":"nashhadu","en":"We testify","root":"شهد","lem":"شَهِدَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّكَ","tr":"innaka","en":"that you"},{"ar":"لَرَسُولُ","tr":"larasūlu","en":"(are) surely (the) Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","tr":"yaʿlamu","en":"knows","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّكَ","tr":"innaka","en":"that you"},{"ar":"لَرَسُولُهُۥ","tr":"larasūluhu","en":"(are) surely His Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"and Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يَشْهَدُ","tr":"yashhadu","en":"testifies","root":"شهد","lem":"شَهِدَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"that"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","tr":"l-munāfiqīna","en":"the hypocrites","root":"نفق","lem":"مُنافِق"},{"ar":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","tr":"lakādhibūna","en":"(are) surely liars","root":"كذب","lem":"كاذِب"}]},{"n":2,"juz":28,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟ أَيْمَـٰنَهُمْ جُنَّةً فَصَدُّوا۟ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ إِنَّهُمْ سَآءَ مَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en":"They have taken their oaths as a cover, so they averted [people] from the way of Allāh. Indeed, it was evil that they were doing.","w":[{"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟","tr":"ittakhadhū","en":"They take","root":"أخذ","lem":"اتَّخَذَ"},{"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنَهُمْ","tr":"aymānahum","en":"their oaths","root":"يمن","lem":"يَمِين"},{"ar":"جُنَّةًۭ","tr":"junnatan","en":"(as) a cover","root":"جنن","lem":"جُنَّة"},{"ar":"فَصَدُّوا۟","tr":"faṣaddū","en":"so they turn away","root":"صدد","lem":"صَدَّ"},{"ar":"عَن","tr":"ʿan","en":"from"},{"ar":"سَبِيلِ","tr":"sabīli","en":"(the) Way","root":"سبل","lem":"سَبِيل"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","tr":"innahum","en":"Indeed, [they]"},{"ar":"سَآءَ","tr":"sāa","en":"evil is","root":"سوأ","lem":"ساءَ"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"كَانُوا۟","tr":"kānū","en":"they used to","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","tr":"yaʿmalūna","en":"do","root":"عمل","lem":"عَمِلَ"}]},{"n":3,"juz":28,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمْ ءَامَنُوا۟ ثُمَّ كَفَرُوا۟ فَطُبِعَ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ فَهُمْ لَا يَفْقَهُونَ","en":"That is because they believed, and then they disbelieved; so their hearts were sealed over, and they do not understand.","w":[{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"That"},{"ar":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","tr":"bi-annahum","en":"(is) because"},{"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","tr":"āmanū","en":"they believed","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"then"},{"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","tr":"kafarū","en":"they disbelieved","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"فَطُبِعَ","tr":"faṭubiʿa","en":"so were sealed","root":"طبع","lem":"طَبَعَ"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"[upon]"},{"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","tr":"qulūbihim","en":"their hearts","root":"قلب","lem":"قَلْب"},{"ar":"فَهُمْ","tr":"fahum","en":"so they"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(do) not"},{"ar":"يَفْقَهُونَ","tr":"yafqahūna","en":"understand","root":"فقه","lem":"يَفْقَهُ"}]},{"n":4,"juz":28,"ar":"۞ وَإِذَا رَأَيْتَهُمْ تُعْجِبُكَ أَجْسَامُهُمْ ۖ وَإِن يَقُولُوا۟ تَسْمَعْ لِقَوْلِهِمْ ۖ كَأَنَّهُمْ خُشُبٌ مُّسَنَّدَةٌ ۖ يَحْسَبُونَ كُلَّ صَيْحَةٍ عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ هُمُ ٱلْعَدُوُّ فَٱحْذَرْهُمْ ۚ قَـٰتَلَهُمُ ٱللَّهُ ۖ أَنَّىٰ يُؤْفَكُونَ","en":"And when you see them, their forms please you, and if they speak, you listen to their speech. [They are] as if they were pieces of wood propped up - they think that every shout is against them. They are the enemy, so beware of them. May Allāh destroy them; how are they deluded?","w":[{"ar":"۞ وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"رَأَيْتَهُمْ","tr":"ra-aytahum","en":"you see them","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"تُعْجِبُكَ","tr":"tuʿ'jibuka","en":"pleases you","root":"عجب","lem":"أَعْجَبَ"},{"ar":"أَجْسَامُهُمْ ۖ","tr":"ajsāmuhum","en":"their bodies","root":"جسم","lem":"جِسْم"},{"ar":"وَإِن","tr":"wa-in","en":"and if"},{"ar":"يَقُولُوا۟","tr":"yaqūlū","en":"they speak","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"تَسْمَعْ","tr":"tasmaʿ","en":"you listen","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"لِقَوْلِهِمْ ۖ","tr":"liqawlihim","en":"to their speech","root":"قول","lem":"قَوْل"},{"ar":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","tr":"ka-annahum","en":"as if they (were)"},{"ar":"خُشُبٌۭ","tr":"khushubun","en":"pieces of wood","root":"خشب","lem":"خُشُب"},{"ar":"مُّسَنَّدَةٌۭ ۖ","tr":"musannadatun","en":"propped up","root":"سند","lem":"مُسَنَّدَة"},{"ar":"يَحْسَبُونَ","tr":"yaḥsabūna","en":"They think","root":"حسب","lem":"حَسِبَ"},{"ar":"كُلَّ","tr":"kulla","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"صَيْحَةٍ","tr":"ṣayḥatin","en":"shout","root":"صيح","lem":"صَيْحَة"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ","tr":"ʿalayhim","en":"(is) against them"},{"ar":"هُمُ","tr":"humu","en":"They"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَدُوُّ","tr":"l-ʿaduwu","en":"(are) the enemy","root":"عدو","lem":"عَدُوّ"},{"ar":"فَٱحْذَرْهُمْ ۚ","tr":"fa-iḥ'dharhum","en":"so beware of them","root":"حذر","lem":"يَحْذَرُ"},{"ar":"قَـٰتَلَهُمُ","tr":"qātalahumu","en":"May destroy them","root":"قتل","lem":"قاتَلَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"أَنَّىٰ","tr":"annā","en":"How"},{"ar":"يُؤْفَكُونَ","tr":"yu'fakūna","en":"are they deluded","root":"أفك","lem":"أُفِكَ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":28,"ar":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمْ تَعَالَوْا۟ يَسْتَغْفِرْ لَكُمْ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ لَوَّوْا۟ رُءُوسَهُمْ وَرَأَيْتَهُمْ يَصُدُّونَ وَهُم مُّسْتَكْبِرُونَ","en":"And when it is said to them, \"Come, the Messenger of Allāh will ask forgiveness for you,\" they turn their heads aside and you see them evading while they are arrogant.","w":[{"ar":"وَإِذَا","tr":"wa-idhā","en":"And when"},{"ar":"قِيلَ","tr":"qīla","en":"it is said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"to them"},{"ar":"تَعَالَوْا۟","tr":"taʿālaw","en":"Come","root":"علو","lem":"تَعالَ"},{"ar":"يَسْتَغْفِرْ","tr":"yastaghfir","en":"will ask forgiveness","root":"غفر","lem":"اسْتَغْفَرَ"},{"ar":"لَكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"for you"},{"ar":"رَسُولُ","tr":"rasūlu","en":"(the) Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"لَوَّوْا۟","tr":"lawwaw","en":"They turn aside","root":"لوي","lem":"لَوَّ"},{"ar":"رُءُوسَهُمْ","tr":"ruūsahum","en":"their heads","root":"رأس","lem":"رَأْس"},{"ar":"وَرَأَيْتَهُمْ","tr":"wara-aytahum","en":"and you see them","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"يَصُدُّونَ","tr":"yaṣuddūna","en":"turning away","root":"صدد","lem":"صَدَّ"},{"ar":"وَهُم","tr":"wahum","en":"while they"},{"ar":"مُّسْتَكْبِرُونَ","tr":"mus'takbirūna","en":"(are) arrogant","root":"كبر","lem":"مُسْتَكْبِر"}]},{"n":6,"juz":28,"ar":"سَوَآءٌ عَلَيْهِمْ أَسْتَغْفَرْتَ لَهُمْ أَمْ لَمْ تَسْتَغْفِرْ لَهُمْ لَن يَغْفِرَ ٱللَّهُ لَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","en":"It is all the same for them whether you ask forgiveness for them or do not ask forgiveness for them; never will Allāh forgive them. Indeed, Allāh does not guide the defiantly disobedient people.","w":[{"ar":"سَوَآءٌ","tr":"sawāon","en":"(It) is same","root":"سوي","lem":"سَواء"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","tr":"ʿalayhim","en":"for them"},{"ar":"أَسْتَغْفَرْتَ","tr":"astaghfarta","en":"whether you ask forgiveness","root":"غفر","lem":"اسْتَغْفَرَ"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"for them"},{"ar":"أَمْ","tr":"am","en":"or"},{"ar":"لَمْ","tr":"lam","en":"(do) not"},{"ar":"تَسْتَغْفِرْ","tr":"tastaghfir","en":"ask forgiveness","root":"غفر","lem":"اسْتَغْفَرَ"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"for them"},{"ar":"لَن","tr":"lan","en":"Never"},{"ar":"يَغْفِرَ","tr":"yaghfira","en":"will forgive","root":"غفر","lem":"غَفَرَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ ۚ","tr":"lahum","en":"[to] them"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(does) not"},{"ar":"يَهْدِى","tr":"yahdī","en":"guide","root":"هدي","lem":"هَدَى"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","tr":"l-qawma","en":"the people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","tr":"l-fāsiqīna","en":"the defiantly disobedient","root":"فسق","lem":"فاسِق"}]},{"n":7,"juz":28,"ar":"هُمُ ٱلَّذِينَ يَقُولُونَ لَا تُنفِقُوا۟ عَلَىٰ مَنْ عِندَ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ حَتَّىٰ يَنفَضُّوا۟ ۗ وَلِلَّهِ خَزَآئِنُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ لَا يَفْقَهُونَ","en":"They are the ones who say, \"Do not spend on those who are with the Messenger of Allāh until they disband.\" And to Allāh belong the depositories of the heavens and the earth, but the hypocrites do not understand.","w":[{"ar":"هُمُ","tr":"humu","en":"They"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"(are) those who"},{"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","tr":"yaqūlūna","en":"say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(Do) not"},{"ar":"تُنفِقُوا۟","tr":"tunfiqū","en":"spend","root":"نفق","lem":"أَنفَقَ"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"on"},{"ar":"مَنْ","tr":"man","en":"(those) who"},{"ar":"عِندَ","tr":"ʿinda","en":"(are) with","root":"عند","lem":"عِند"},{"ar":"رَسُولِ","tr":"rasūli","en":"(the) Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"ٱللَّه